<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea Shipping - Steel scrap cargoes - April 16.</title>
<headline>S.Korea Shipping - Steel scrap cargoes - April 16.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the arrival schedule for major steel scrap vessels unloading at South Korean ports of Inchon, Pusan, Masan, Pohang, Kwangyang and Asan, as detailed on Wednesday by South Korean surveyors.</p>
<p>Steel scrap cargoes</p>
<p>-- INCHON PORT</p>
<p> VESSEL	    TONNE    ETA	 ETD	  BUYER</p>
<p> Silver	    35,000   Apr 17    Apr 26     Inchon</p>
<p> Feng Kang	 45,000   Apr 30    May 10     Inchon</p>
<p>-- PUSAN PORT</p>
<p>No vessel calling schedule yet</p>
<p>-- MASAN PORT</p>
<p>No vessel calling schedule yet</p>
<p>-- POHANG PORT</p>
<p> Xing Su Hai     22,000   Mar 30    Apr 18     Kangwon</p>
<p> John-L	    30,000   Apr 16    May 2	POSCO</p>
<p> Pac Duck	  30,000   May 10    May 27     POSCO</p>
<p>-- KWANGYANG PORT</p>
<p> Aspidoporos     30,500   Apr 20		   POSCO</p>
<p>-- ASAN PORT</p>
<p> World Argonaut  32,993   Apr 14    Apr 26     Hanbo</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
